						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<h2 class="bb_tag" >Story</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Player control armored truck in this endless runner shooter game. Take control of a truck and survive on an endless highway filled with dangerous zombies, dynamic obstacles, and intense action. Road is full of zombies, player can shoot zombies with armored truck weapons or just run over zombies. Collect coins and survive enough long to earn steam achievements. Player armored truck will be destroyed if it will hit obstacles like trees, spikes or broken vehicles which can appear suddenly. So can you survive enough long and kill as many zombies as you can in this horror themed endless runner shooter game</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Features:</h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Steam achievements</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Control armored truck </p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Shoot zombies or run over the zombies</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Avoid obstacles like trees, spikes and broken vehicles</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Survive longer to earn steam achievement</p></li></ul>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
			<h2>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2>
			<p>The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
					Steam store page logo and cover art made with ai tools				</i>
			</p>
					</div>
	</div>
	
				
				
